+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386)
+and returns a new JSON document without mutating either input. Object members with `null` patch
+values are removed; arrays and scalar patch values replace the target.
